## Downloaded at setup time (`data/`, not tracked)

### King James Version — public domain
- Source: https://github.com/thiagobodruk/bible
- Licence: public domain

### Berean Standard Bible — public domain
Indexed as a modern-English search mirror only; Shiloh always displays the KJV
unless you ask for BSB on a specific passage.

- Source: https://github.com/scrollmapper/bible_databases
- Licence: public domain (the BSB is released into the public domain by its publisher)

